<body>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><a href="https://wordtohtml.net/3D%22https:/youtu.be/UjPjPjVsz2w?t=3D1%22">https://youtu.be/UjPjPjVs= z2w?t=3D1</a></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare,&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alaba= re</strong></span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;(4x),&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</strong></span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;A Mi Senor</strong><strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>John Saw&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>The</span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;Number, Of All Those Redeemed,</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>And All Were Singing Praises To The Lord</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Thousands Were Praying, Ten Thousands Rejoicing</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>And All Were Singing Praises To The Lord.</strong></strong></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare,&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alaba= re</strong></span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;(4x),&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</strong></span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;A Mi Senor</strong><strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>There Is None, There Is None! (2x)</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>There&rsquo;s No God Who Does&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>The</span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;Mighty Wonders</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>That The Lord Our God Has Done! (2x)</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Not&nbsp;</strong><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>With</span><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>&nbsp;An Army, Nor With Their Weapons,</strong><br> <strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>But By The Holy Spirit&rsquo;s Power (2x).</strong></strong></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare, Alabare (4x), Alabare A Mi Senor</strong></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</strong></span><strong>, <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alaba= re</span>, <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</span> A Mi Senor [2] And Even Mountains Shall= Be Moved [3] By <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>The</span> Holy Spirit&rsquo;s Power.=&nbsp;</strong></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</strong></span><strong>, <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alaba= re</span>, <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare</span> A Mi Senor [2] And Also India Shall Be = Saved [3] By <span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>The</span> Holy Spirit&rsquo;s Power.</strong></p>
    <p style="margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;"><strong style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'>Alabare, Alabare, Alabare A Mi Senor [2]</strong></p>
